"<b>Frame stack</b>"
"<p>Often referred to as the \"call stack\", this is a list showing which function is currently active, and what called each function to get to this point in your program. By clicking on an item you can see the values in any of the previous calling functions.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Rahmenstapel</b>"
"<p>Faken ok \"Oproop-Stapel\" nöömt. Disse List wiest de opstunns aktive Funkschoon, un wokeen de Funkschonen op den Padd na dissen Punkt in Dien Programm opropen hett. Wenn Du op de Indrääg klickst, kannst Du de Weerten in all verleden Oproopfunkschonen bekieken.</p>"

